## 7 SO1 docs (per-project canonical, persistent)

User curated this list across multiple iterations. Locked at 7 (Doc 6 Inspirations dropped).

### Doc 1 â€” Project Overview (`overview.yaml` + DB)
14 components: slug, display_name, summary (tagline+short+core_idea), current_status, lifecycle_phase, scope_size, target_devices, hosting_target, port, public_url, repository_url, problem_statement, non_goals (â‰¥1), success_criteria (â‰¥3), preferences (likes/dislikes/must_haves/avoid carried from ND1).

### Doc 2 â€” User Flows (`flows.yaml` + DB)
18 components: id, parent_id, title, trigger, expected_outcome, type (ui/backend/automated/mixed), priority, test_status, linked_playwright_test, linked_active_bugs, last_tested_date, tags, notes; arrays: steps (ordered actor/action/result, â‰¥2), pre_conditions, edge_cases; M:N: linked_features (â‰¥1), linked_pages (â‰¥1 for UI flows).

### Doc 3 â€” Features (`features.yaml` + DB)
15 components: id, parent_id, title, short_description, type, status, priority, size, acceptance_criteria (â‰¥1, max 5), test_status (derived: AND of linked flow statuses), tags, notes; M:N: linked_flows, linked_pages, dependencies.

### Doc 4 â€” UI Pages & Components (`ui.yaml` + DB)
Pages (13 fields): id, title, route, purpose, layout_type, empty/loading/error states, permissions, mobile_handling, entry_points; M:N linked_features + linked_flows. Components per page (9 fields): name, purpose_on_page, category, possible_variants, data_consumed, data_produced, picked, asset_library_ref; nested under pages in YAML.

### Doc 5 â€” Data Overview (`data.yaml` + DB) â€” split per Codex P1 #9
**Stage 1 conceptual:** sources (with R1-R4 recurring fetch fields), retention_policy, seed_data_plan, data_quality_rules, known_quality_issues, freshness_alerts.
**Stage 2 contract:** database_engine, storage_location, migration_tooling, tables (columns/types/nullable/default), indexes, constraints, relationships.

### Doc 7 â€” Risks (`risks.yaml` + DB)
Risk instances (linked to global catalog), policies (exposure/access/sensitivity/encryption/retention/rate-limit), third-party services, auth_config, secrets (NAMES only, no values).
Lifecycle: `resolved` status (with `resolved_at` + `resolution_summary`, hidden by default) â€” NOT deletion (Codex P1 #10).
Per-target join tables: risk_instance_features / pages / integrations / secrets / data_tables (Codex P2 #17 â€” no polymorphic FKs).

### Doc 8 â€” Decisions / ADRs (`decisions/<date>-<slug>.md` per ADR + DB index)
10 fields: id, title, date, status, tags, linked_features, linked_risks, superseded_by, deprecated_reason, body (markdown sections: Context / Decision / Consequences).

**Doc 6 â€” Inspirations DROPPED.** Sample sites flow to central UI asset repo + ND1 preferences instead.

