## ND1 (Stage 1 INPUT, ephemeral)

28 components, 18 mandatory + 10 conditional. Common schema across Type 1 + Type 2.

Mandatory: proposed_slug, proposed_display_name, journey_type, sanity_check_results, core_idea, problem_statement, target_users, non_goals_initial, success_criteria_initial (â‰¥3), likes, dislikes, must_haves, avoid, features_sketch (â‰¥1), flows_sketch, risk_concerns_initial, created_at, session_id.

Conditional (Type 2 / when applicable): inspirations, F1_code, F2_docs, F3_samples, F4_data, data_sketch, ui_hints, tech_hints, integrations_initial, auth_intent.

Lifecycle: archived to `staging/archive/ND1-<datetime>.yaml` after Stage 1 completes.

