## Onboarding 13 existing projects

### Pilot scope (per user direction): 3 projects first
1. **ottomate-tracker-v3 itself** (meta â€” dogfood)
2. **balls-of-the-bull (BOTB)** â€” has RCS blocker as 1st iter
3. **tasks** â€” onboarded as TRACKED PROJECT (not merged with tracker)

### Onboarding modes
- **Lite** â€” manifest only; for stable shipped projects
- **Standard** â€” full SO1 backfill from artifacts; for active builds (DEFAULT)
- **Full** â€” Standard + Stage 2 backfill (UI Master Plan + tech-stack + architecture diagram); for portfolio showcase
- **Archive** â€” don't migrate; keep v2 row as historical

### Per-project recommendations (from 13-project audit)
- cricket-stats: Full (best v2 data, pilot candidate before BOTB)
- cap-a: Full (mapping showcase)
- balls-of-the-bull: Standard + secret scan
- desi-skies: Full (live, complex pipeline)
- health: Standard + DB-empty as 1st iter
- home: Standard
- media-dashboard: Full (best test coverage)
- ingest: Standard (Python project)
- paata: Standard (move to Docker)
- tasks: Standard (separate app, only metadata)
- portfolio / sms-receiver / vacayornay-data: Archive (empty)

### Stage4-lite for legacy (Codex P1 #6)
Most existing projects don't have Stage 3-quality tests. Reduced Stage 4 mode until acceptance criteria + baseline tests exist.

### Mandatory historical-doc secret scan (Codex P1 #7)
BOTB CLAUDE.md has PDF passwords for credit cards. ALL existing CLAUDE.md files must be scanned + redacted before tracker DB ingest.

